      "created_at": "2014-05-29T06:38:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you still have money after you buy a card, you can buy the card beneath it. You are not limited to just the top three cards.</p><p>If you are flipping cards due to unengaged ships, you flip them from left to right.</p><p>One unengaged ship, flip the leftmost card. Two unengaged ships, flip the leftmost and the middle. If there are three or more unengaged ships, flip all three.</p>",
